{
  "text": "One thing in all of this is rented, and this ring is the meter on it, the engine. Claude today, something else tomorrow, belongs to somebody else, and you pay for what you use. There's your five-hour limit and your weekly limit. Everything else is yours, your business brain, your rules, your team, your files, sitting on your own machine as plain files you could open in a text editor. Change engines one day and you keep every single bit of it. Glance at the ring before a big job. That's all it's there for.",
